{
  "attribution": {
    "commit": "",
    "pr": "",
    "sessionUrl": false
  },
  "permissions": {
    "additionalDirectories": [
      "{{ .chezmoi.homeDir }}/Code/murmure/metacognition"
    ]
  },
  "hooks": {
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Bash",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "rtk hook claude"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "statusLine": {
    "type": "command",
    "command": "bash {{ .chezmoi.homeDir }}/.claude/statusline-command.sh"
  },
  "enabledPlugins": {
    "superpowers@superpowers-marketplace": true,
    "ponytail@ponytail": true
  },
  "extraKnownMarketplaces": {
    "superpowers-marketplace": {
      "source": {
        "source": "github",
        "repo": "obra/superpowers-marketplace"
      }
    },
    "ponytail": {
      "source": {
        "source": "github",
        "repo": "DietrichGebert/ponytail"
      },
      "autoUpdate": true
    },
    "murmure-marketplace": {
      "source": {
        "source": "git",
        "url": "git@gitlab.dnm.radiofrance.fr:murmure/claude-marketplace.git"
      }
    }
  },
  "modelSettings": {
    "claude-opus-5-5": {
      "effortLevel": "high"
    }
  },
  "advisorModel": "opus",
  "theme": "custom:jelly",
  "agentPushNotifEnabled": true,
  "autoMode": {
    "soft_deny": [
      "$defaults",
      "Bash(kubectl delete:*) — scoped to k8s namespaces seen in usage (source, ppmurmure, test, etc.), pending explicit confirmation for destructive cluster ops",
      "Bash(glab mr merge:*) — merge-without-review risk on gitlab.dnm.radiofrance.fr/murmure/scissors"
    ],
    "environment": [
      "### Org-wide",
      "**Organization**: RadioFrance (gitlab.dnm.radiofrance.fr — this repo's remote org: murmure)",
      "**Cloud provider(s)**: None configured",
      "**Repository visibility**: assume private — not queryable via gh (unsupported/GHE host), remote is gitlab.dnm.radiofrance.fr/murmure/scissors, an internal RadioFrance GitLab instance",
      "**Internal sharing / snippet hosting**: None configured — treat public paste/gist services as outside the trust boundary",
      "**Secrets management**: source/config.local.json holds local secrets and must not be committed (per repo CLAUDE.md)",
      "**Default / protected branches**: main is default; do not modify main directly — always branch from an updated main (per repo CLAUDE.md); branch protection not queryable via gh here",
      "**CI/CD deploy targets**: None configured",
      "**Network posture**: None configured",
      "**Host containment**: None configured — assume Claude Code runs on an ordinary developer machine with open internet",
      "**Source control**: This repo (gitlab.dnm.radiofrance.fr/murmure/scissors) and its origin remote only",
      "**Trusted internal domains**: apipreprod.priv.radiofrance.dev, apistaging.priv.radiofrance.dev, gitlab.dnm.radiofrance.fr, nexus-production.dnm.radiofrance.fr",
      "**Trusted cloud buckets**: None configured",
      "**Key internal services**: Troubadour (transcript API), Bifrost (LLM gateway), Grimoire (persistence layer), Graphity (GraphQL API — always target apipreprod, never staging per repo CLAUDE.md)",
      "**Internal package registry**: nexus-production.dnm.radiofrance.fr",
      "**Sensitive data locations & audiences**: source/config.local.json (local secrets, never commit); any file or store holding personal data, confidential business data, credentials, regulated data, or similarly sensitive material — share only with audiences cleared at the [named+specifics] bar",
      "**Data retention / declassification**: None configured",
      "**Sensitive remote targets**: any namespace, host, or container whose name carries prod or production as a whole word or name segment; note k8s namespace usage includes ppmurmure and test, and apipreprod/apistaging hosts are pre-production, not production",
      "**Protected deployment namespaces / environments**: None configured — fall back to the Sensitive remote targets heuristic",
      "**Protected IaC scopes**: IAM, RBAC, networking, quota, and node-pool resources; anything whose name or tag carries prod or production as a whole word or name segment",
      "### User-specific",
      "**Primary use of Claude Code**: software development (Node.js/TypeScript service for radio transcript chronic-boundary detection)",
      "**Trusted repo**: {{ .chezmoi.homeDir }}/Code/murmure/scissors (gitlab.dnm.radiofrance.fr/murmure/scissors) and its origin remote",
      "**Org-specific CLIs**: glab (GitLab CLI, used routinely), rtk (used for lint/build-check per repo CLAUDE.md), kubectl (cluster operations), chezmoi (used for ~/.config management per user's global CLAUDE.md)",
      "routine under gitlab.dnm.radiofrance.fr/murmure/ prefix for this project's git and MR operations"
    ]
  }
}
